# ── Game data ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This repository is BYOA: not one byte of LBA1 lives here. Everything below
# is staged from your own copy of the game by tools/make_*_nds.sh, and must
# never be committed. The directory rules cover where the scripts put things;
# the extension rules catch a stray copy anywhere else in the tree.
platform/nds/nitrofiles/
platform/nds/sd_files/
platform/sdl/testdata/
milestones/*/nitrofiles/
sd_root/
testdata/
dist/

*.hqr
*.HQR
*.vox
*.VOX
*.voc
*.VOC
*.lba
*.LBA
*.lst
*.LST
lba.cfg
LBA.CFG
*.dat
*.DAT
*.dot
*.DOT
*.fla
*.FLA
*.mp3
*.wav
*.bmp
*.pcx

# ── Build output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
build/
*.o
*.d
*.elf
*.nds
*.map
*.exe
*.dll
*.stamp
*.log

# ── Upstream reference ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# A pristine copy of lba1-classic-community is kept locally to diff against.
# It is not ours to redistribute here — see README, "Where the engine
# comes from", for the upstream URL.
lba1-classic-community-main/

